</div><h1 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-black tracking-tight md:text-3xl\">Batch image optimization &amp; WebP/AVIF conversion</h1><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/70\">Compress JPEG, PNG, WebP &amp; AVIF images by up to 80% directly in your browser. Strip sensitive EXIF location metadata and convert to responsive social presets.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-rule bg-ink-3 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-[10px] font-medium text-paper/80\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4 text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Zaibi Tools Enterprise</span></div></div></section><div class=\"h-[250px] w-full md:h-[90px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12\"><aside class=\"space-y-5 rounded-2xl border border-line bg-paper-2 p-6 shadow-sm transition-colors dark:border-rule dark:bg-ink-2 dark:shadow-xl lg:col-span-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-line pb-4 dark:border-rule\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sliders-vertical h-4 w-4 text-doc dark:text-doc-bright\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 8h4\"></path><path d=\"M12 21v-9\"></path><path d=\"M12 8V3\"></path><path d=\"M17 16h4\"></path><path d=\"M19 12V3\"></path><path d=\"M19 21v-5\"></path><path d=\"M3 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M5 10V3\"><